                ["C. Defer Could-haves", "None", "None", "Dashboard and labels deferred", "Yes, with all tolerance kept"],
                ["D. Hybrid", "+2 weeks", "+£11,000", "Labels deferred", "Yes, but no time reserve and £1,000 of cost tolerance left"],
